  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Australia Labour Mobility Scheme (Vanuatu)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Labour Mobility schemes (Seasonal Worker Programme and Pacific Labour Scheme) help to fill critical workforce shortages in Australia and provide ni-Vanuatu workers with the skills, experience and remittances to contribute to Vanuatu&#x2019;s economic development. This investment will support Vanuatu&#x2019;s strong engagement in the labour mobility schemes and its position as a source of high-quality workers for Approved Employers in Australia. It will help to increase the quality of training provided to workers, both prior to and following deployments, as well as the ongoing operations of the Department of Labour to ensure high-quality processes around sending workers to Australia. The expected outcome is that participants in the schemes are well equipped with the skills and knowledge to complete placements in Australia and to successfully reintegrate to Vanuatu&#x2019;s society and economy upon their return.</narrative>
  </description>
